OL,3,GNEWSACould Welsh depot solve fridge
OL,4,Arecycling "crisis"?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disused fridge and freezer recycling
OL,7,Fdepot in Wales has been earmarked as a
OL,8,Fpossible solution to the national
OL,9,Fbacklog in processing the appliances.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council has written
OL,12,Fto the government, suggesting the
OL,13,Ffacility in Newport should reopen to
OL,14,Fhelp with the "crisis" as the equipment
OL,15,Fis still on site to recycle the white
OL,16,Fgoods.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
