OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACould Welsh depot solve fridge
OL,4,Arecycling "crisis"?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Gordon, cabinet member for
OL,7,Feconomy and the environment at
OL,8,FOxfordshire County Council said
OL,9,Freopening the site would "enable
OL,10,Feveryone to keep moving and recycling
OL,11,Ftheir fridges and freezers as normal".
OL,13,FIt's after the local authority
OL,14,Fintroduced a booking system for the
OL,15,Fappliances, to limit the daily number
OL,16,Faccepted at household tips.
